      ],
      "extract": "The methods of effective field theory and in particular ChPT can also be used for extensions. A simple extension is to take QCD with $N$ light flavours but one can also envisage using $N$ fermions in different representations of the gauge group. The representations can be complex, real or pseudo-real so we have in general three generic cases to study for the spontaneous breaking of the global symmetries",
      "extractCut": true
